<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Two More Walk Graphs at a Glance</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The same four primitives express qualitatively different model
families.
Two examples make the range concrete.</span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph" style="font-size:90%;">Qwen3-Omni: three partitions, two streaming edges.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qwen3-Omni </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">44</a><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> is an omni-modality LLM in a
three-partition topology: a Thinker (text-out AR LLM), a Talker
(codec-token AR LLM), and Code2Wav (audio-codec vocoder), each on its
own rank. The Thinker streams hidden states to the Talker via a
</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">FixedChunkPolicy(<math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K{=}1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">StreamingGraphEdge</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, and
the Talker streams codec frames to Code2Wav via a
</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">LeftContextChunkPolicy</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. Eight Walks span the three
partitions, including separate prefill Walks per input modality and
separate prefill / last-prefill / decode Walks for the Talker.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph" style="font-size:90%;">V-JEPA 2: five Walks selected per request.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">V-JEPA 2 </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> is a video world model whose
predictor is reused across distinct tasks. Its action-conditioned
variant declares five Walks: a single-shot </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">prefill_video</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;
an </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">encoder_only</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Walk for cross-Walk pre-encoding; a batched
</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">rollout</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Walk built around a </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">DynamicLoop</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> with
per-request horizon </span><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; a </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">streaming_rollout</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> variant that
emits each iter’s prediction immediately; and an MPC Walk that runs
the predictor with </span><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> candidate action sequences in one batched
forward, scored by an </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">mpc_scorer</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> node — </span><math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.19" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">-way
model-predictive control as a 3-node </span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Sequential</span><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.21" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. The same
predictor weights serve all five Walks. The masked-predictor variant
declares the same set minus the MPC Walk.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Walk Graph Primitives: Full Signatures and Semantics</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table </span><a href="#A2.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix B Walk Graph Primitives: Full Signatures and Semantics ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a><span id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> gives the full signatures and semantics of
the four composable primitives summarized in
§</span><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="Four composable primitives. ‣ 3.1 API ‣ 3 The Walk Graph ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a><span id="A2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, plus the streaming edge variant
</span><span id="A2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">StreamingGraphEdge</span><span id="A2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>The four composable primitives that generate a Walk Graph,
plus the streaming variant of <span id="A2.T2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GraphEdge</span>. <span id="A2.T2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GraphNode</span>
and <span id="A2.T2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GraphEdge</span> are the atomic types; the composite primitives
below close under nesting.</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T2.13" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T2.13.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Primitive</span></th>
<th id="A2.T2.13.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Signature</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A2.T2.13.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Semantics</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T2.13.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Sequential</span></th>
<td id="A2.T2.13.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{list[Section]}\to\texttt{Section}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">list[Section]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{list[Section]}\to\texttt{Section}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.13.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Chain — outputs of one section feed the next.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.13.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Parallel</span></th>
<td id="A2.T2.13.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{list[Section]}\to\texttt{Section}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">list[Section]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{list[Section]}\to\texttt{Section}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.13.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fan-out — children execute concurrently on (possibly distinct) ranks.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.13.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Loop</span></th>
<td id="A2.T2.13.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{Section}\times\texttt{int}\to\texttt{Section}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">int</mtext></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{Section}\times\texttt{int}\to\texttt{Section}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.13.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Bounded iteration. Two output channels: </span><span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">outputs</span><span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (cache wiped per iter — only the last iter’s tensor flows downstream) and </span><span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">accumulated_outputs</span><span id="A2.T2.13.4.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (cache persists across iters — every iter’s contribution is concatenated and emitted en bloc). Disjoint by name.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.13.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">DynamicLoop</span></th>
<td id="A2.T2.13.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{Section}\times\texttt{int}_{\max}\times\texttt{str}\to\texttt{Section}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">int</mtext><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">str</mtext></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Section</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{Section}\times\texttt{int}_{\max}\times\texttt{str}\to\texttt{Section}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.13.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Loop</span><span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> with per-request early-exit. A submodule signals stop via </span><span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">request_info.register_loop_stop(name)</span><span id="A2.T2.13.5.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; on the next iter boundary the runtime advances to terminal outputs. Used for EOS and rollout horizon.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.13.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T2.13.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.13.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">StreamingGraphEdge</span></th>
<td id="A2.T2.13.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:102.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{str}\times\texttt{ChunkPolicy}\to\texttt{Edge}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">str</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">ChunkPolicy</mtext></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">Edge</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{str}\times\texttt{ChunkPolicy}\to\texttt{Edge}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.13.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.9pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:187.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Streaming variant of </span><span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">GraphEdge</span><span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. Producer emits one tensor at a time; the consumer’s </span><span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">StreamBuffer</span><span id="A2.T2.13.6.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> accumulates and gates dispatch via the policy.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
