<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Deferred Experimental Results</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure </span><a href="#A5.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix E Deferred Experimental Results ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a><span id="A5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> compares vLLM-Omni with </span><span id="A5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">M*</span><span id="A5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> for T2I and I2I job completion time, on a single H100 (no CFG-parallelism).</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.12688v1/figure/release/bagel_t2i_i2i_1gpu.png" id="A5.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:405/222;" width="405" height="222" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span><span id="A5.F9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BAGEL T2I and I2I, single H100, <math id="A5.F9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B{=}1</annotation></semantics></math>.</span> <span id="A5.F9.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">M*</span> wins on both; the gap widens for I2I.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">M*</span><span id="A5.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> improves on vLLM-Omni’s T2I p50 latency by </span><math id="A5.p2.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="1.13\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1.13</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.13\times</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A5.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
For I2I, </span><span id="A5.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">M*</span><span id="A5.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> also improves on default config vLLM-Omni’s I2I p50 latency by
</span><math id="A5.p2.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="1.66\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1.66</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.66\times</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A5.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="A5.p2.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="1.25\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1.25</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.25\times</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A5.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> for vLLM Omni’s single-stage config (</span><a href="#A5.F9" title="In Appendix E Deferred Experimental Results ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a><span id="A5.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">).</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.12688v1/figure/release/bagel_i2t_1x3_short.png" id="A5.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:471/211;" width="471" height="211" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span><span id="A5.F10.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BAGEL I2T, single H100, <math id="A5.F10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B\in\{1,2,4,\dots,16\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B\in\{1,2,4,\dots,16\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>, <span id="A5.F10.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ignore_eos</span> with output lengths between 16 and 128. (a) TTFT (log <math id="A5.F10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>). (b) Throughput (req/s). (c) End-to-end request latency.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.12688v1/figure/release/bagel_i2t_1x3_long.png" id="A5.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:471/211;" width="471" height="211" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span><span id="A5.F11.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BAGEL I2T, single H100, <math id="A5.F11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B\in\{1,2,4,\dots,16\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B\in\{1,2,4,\dots,16\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>, <span id="A5.F11.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ignore_eos</span> with output lengths between 128 and 512. (a) TTFT (log <math id="A5.F11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>). (b) Throughput (req/s). (c) End-to-end request latency.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figures </span><a href="#A5.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix E Deferred Experimental Results ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a><span id="A5.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><a href="#A5.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix E Deferred Experimental Results ‣ M*: A Modular, Extensible, Serving Systemfor Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a><span id="A5.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> show </span><span id="A5.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">M*</span><span id="A5.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> vs. vLLM-Omni on BAGEL I2T for varying output length workloads: one where output lengths are randomly sampled between 16 and 64 tokens, and one where output lengths range from 128 to 512 tokens.
Overall, we have the largest advantage on shorter-decode and higher-concurrency workloads, while remaining comparable in the longer-sequence, lower-concurrency setting.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Walk Graph Primitives: Image Generation Walk with CFG Parallelism</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
<div id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx24" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">image_gen_cfg</span><span id="lstnumberx24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx24.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx24.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Sequential</span><span id="lstnumberx24.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">([</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx25" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Loop</span><span id="lstnumberx25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">(</span>
</div>
